<title>ITALY: TENNIS - KORDA DEFEATS HENMAN 6-4 6-4 IN MILAN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS - KORDA DEFEATS HENMAN 6-4 6-4 IN MILAN.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN, Italy 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech Petr Korda upset Britain's Tim Henman 6-4 6-4 in the second round of the $815,000 Milan indoor men's tennis tournament on Thursday.</p>
<p>The unseeded Czech made breaks in both sets stand as he beat the fourth-seeded Henman in straight sets.</p>
</text>
